{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38062","headline":"洞庭玩月 · 韩偓","name":"洞庭玩月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洞庭湖上清秋月，月皎湖宽万顷霜。\n玉椀深沈潭底白，金杯细碎浪头光。\n寒惊乌鹊离巢噪，冷射蛟螭换窟藏。\n更忆瑶台逢此夜，水晶宫殿挹琼浆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38062.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38062","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}